      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sinclairville hosts an annual History Fair, Christmas in the Park celebration, and the Cassadaga Concert Band Performance each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofsinclairvilleny.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Valley Historical Society Museum, a centerpiece of local heritage, is located in Sinclairville.",
